{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o066a","title":"孙权遣张温使蜀","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o066a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"孙权遣张温使蜀","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o066a-q"]},{"id":"yululu-a-725e7e8e46b06104d11a","label":"正文","text":"张温以辅义中郎将使蜀","evidence":["yululu-q-0f2ffd62718b8fbde040"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"遣使","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o066a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0044","role":"奉使","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o066a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":224,"label":"黄武三年夏","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y224","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o066","basis":"黄武三年夏"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o066a-q","wuzhu-q-o066","houfei-q-o038","houfei-q-b-4f3492a2a614a7fb6301"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o066a-q","source_order":[47,358,"O066a"],"order":8251}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0044","name":"张温（吴使臣）","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-b-4f3492a2a614a7fb6301","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-4f3492a2a614a7fb6301","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗五年：黄初五年（公元 224 ）。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":189,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-da0e639fdf857f1cccce","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"houfei-q-o038","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-10fa24c108af165ad605","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖4〗，帝东征，后留许昌永始台。时霖雨百余日，城楼多坏，有司奏请移止。后曰：“昔楚昭王出游〖5〗，贞姜留渐台〖6〗；江水至，使者迎而无符〖7〗，不去，卒没。今帝在远，吾幸未有是患；而便移止，奈何〖8〗？”群臣莫敢复言。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o066a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-adff9cb83c11e6985e1e","layer":"original","quote":"三年夏〖9〗，遣辅义中郎将张温，聘于蜀〖10〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":357,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24},{"id"